line	<str>Travel to fairy code CKP. Wait here (2-5 mins) until a star flower has grown then pick it. (You must have Nuff's certificate with you for this to work.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to fairy code DIR. Kill a gorak and pick up its gorak claws. Goraks can be safespotted using some terrain.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the hideout. (AIR, DLR, DJQ, AJS)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Fairy Nuff.</str>
line	
line	<str>Now use the star flower on your vial of water and grind the gorak claws to receive gorak claw powder, then use the two items on each other to make a magic essence potion.</str>
line	
line	<str>RIGHT-CLICK use the magic essence on the queen, laying on the stretcher near Fairy Nuff.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak with the Fairy Queen to complete the quest.</col>
done	<str>Take all required items with you.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Martin the Master Gardener in the Draynor Market.</str>
done	
done	<str>Wait 5 minutes (Real World Time) and speak to Martin the Master Gardener again.</str>
done	
done	<str>Now make your way to Fairy Nuff's grotto, just north of the bank in Zanaris.</str>
done	
done	<str>Take Nuff's Healing certificate off the floor, right-click it and study it. (If lost, you can obtain another Healing certificate by searching the Potion shelves in Fairy Nuff's grotto.)</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to the south-west area of Zanaris, read the Rune temple sign just south of the Cosmic Altar.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to the Fairy Godfather in the throne room.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to the Co-ordinator just north of the throne room. You can now use the fairy rings.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Fairy Fixit near the fairy ring west of the throne room.</str>
done	
done	<str>Now, equip your Dramen staff, and teleport using the fairy ring in this sequence: AIR, DLR, DJQ (You will not go anywhere), AJS - (Note: You can right click configure but you must have the Nuff's certificate in your inventory)</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Fairy Nuff and Fairy Very Wise in the NE corner of the area.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go back to Zanaris (BKS) and pickpocket the Fairy Godfather while he and his henchmen aren't looking.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go back to the hideout and give the Queen's secateurs to Fairy Nuff. (AIR, DLR, DJQ, AJS)</str>
done	
